    {
      "reason": "The affected API is DTLS handshake retransmission. PostgreSQL uses TCP, supports TLS rather than DTLS, and has no published port in this topology. No service in this container uses a DTLS peer or the openssl DTLS command. Debian bookworm has no fixed package listed for this advisory; retain the existing assessment expiry.",
      "target": "postgres:18.6-bookworm@sha256:3725f4e2499eef5134592b3b4ab79a543ed7f8e533b05b5b637af926630f6650 (debian 12.15)",
